FAIL testdata/bad/duplicate-key.yaml:3:1  PQ1041: "timeout" is set twice in a job

   1 | name: report
   2 | timeout: 30m
>  3 | timeout: 45m
       ^
   4 | steps:

   A mapping holds each key once. The second one wins silently in most YAML readers,
   which is how a job ends up running with a value nobody can find in the file.
   Delete the one you did not mean.

   paceq error PQ1041  for the full explanation
